
# Ohm's Law and Power Calculator

## What it does
This Python program calculates voltage, current, resistance and electrical power using Ohm's Law. It also allows users to view their previous calculations.

## How to run it
Install Python 3 or Pydroid 3.

Run the program using:
python ohms_law_calculator.py

